## 6. Core Value Propositions

### VP1: "Every request, one front door"
Employees submit purchase requests through a single, intuitive form. No more Slack messages, emails, or hallway asks. Every request is captured, tracked, and visible.

**Metric:** 90%+ of purchases go through Reqflow within 60 days of deployment.

### VP2: "Approved in hours, not days"
AI-powered routing sends requests to the right approver instantly. Smart forms adapt based on amount, category, and department. Push notifications ensure approvers respond fast.

**Metric:** Median approval time under 4 hours (down from 2.3 days industry average).

### VP3: "Budget guardrails, not budget surprises"
Real-time budget tracking with automatic enforcement. Departments see their remaining budget before requesting. Hard stops prevent overspending. Forecasting warns before budgets run dry.

**Metric:** 95%+ of departments stay within budget (up from ~70% without controls).

### VP4: "Audit-ready by default"
Every request, approval, PO, invoice, and payment is automatically logged with timestamps, approvers, and full context. Compliance documentation is always current. Ready for SOC 2, ISO 27001, or any audit.

**Metric:** Audit preparation time reduced by 80%.

### VP5: "5 minutes to first request"
No implementation project. No consultants. Connect your email, import your vendors, configure 3 approval rules, and you're live. AI helps set up everything else.

**Metric:** Time from signup to first purchase request processed: under 5 minutes.

